      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>HoYoverse Announces Cosy Galactic Life Sim 'Petit Planet' For Switch 2</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The free-to-play title launches in 2027.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;HoYoverse, the company known for games like &lt;strong&gt;Genshin Impact&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Zenless Zone Zero&lt;/strong&gt;, has announced it's bringing the cosy free-to-play galactic life sim &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.nintendolife.com/games/nintendo-switch-2/petit-planet"&gt;Petit Planet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to the Switch 2 in &lt;strong&gt;2027&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It shared news about the Nintendo version of the game at the end of its latest &lt;a class="external" href="https://youtu.be/CTQeBMLVY1M?t=1708"&gt;"pre-launch special program" broadcast&lt;/a&gt;. Petit Planet is launching for &lt;em&gt;other&lt;/em&gt; platforms on &lt;strong&gt;4th December 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read the &lt;a href="https://www.nintendolife.com/news/2026/11/hoyoverse-announces-cosy-galactic-life-sim-petit-planet-for-switch-2"&gt;full article on nintendolife.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nintendolife.com/#article-208441</guid>
      <link>https://www.nintendolife.com/news/2026/11/hoyoverse-announces-cosy-galactic-life-sim-petit-planet-for-switch-2</link>
      <media:thumbnail url="https://images.nintendolife.com/6a092d6cb4101/small.jpg" />
      <media:content url="https://images.nintendolife.com/6a092d6cb4101/large.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <title>Watch: Nintendo Treehouse Plays Pikmin 4 - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + Dandori Academy</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A special broadcast timed in with Pikmin Day.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apart from its Pikmin Day Direct, Nintendo has announced it's hosting a special Treehouse broadcast for &lt;a href="https://www.nintendolife.com/games/nintendo-switch-2/pikmin-4-nintendo-switch-2-edition-plus-dandori-academy"&gt;Pikmin 4 - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + Dandori Academy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Its airs later today on &lt;a class="external" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/nintendo"&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt; and will give fans a better look at this version of the game, and what you can expect before you jump into it on &lt;strong&gt;12th November 2026&lt;/strong&gt;. Here are the times for the upcoming Treehouse Direct:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read the &lt;a href="https://www.nintendolife.com/news/2026/11/watch-nintendo-treehouse-plays-pikmin-4-nintendo-switch-2-edition-plus-dandori-academy"&gt;full article on nintendolife.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
